pleting hacks.Changed fast restart to F10 instead of F12.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T20:42:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067945277","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:43:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4334700-1846018067937315","game_id":"steam-4334700","kind":"update","title":"Patch 0.1.04.002","summary":"Another small patch! 0.1.04.002Added more commands to the command hack.Adjusted the difficulty on multiple hacks.My idea for this game is for it to be quite difficult, so I have been hesitating on large balance changes. Before the release of the demo I play tested the game with other people and they also complained about the difficulty, and some changes were made before the demo came out. However it seems there still is a difficulty problem. I have changed the balance of the difficulty to make t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T21:08:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067937315","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:43:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4334700-1846018067935334","game_id":"steam-4334700","kind":"update","title":"Patch 0.1.04.001","summary":"Thank you to everyone who has played the demo so far! I'm releasing a small patch for the game that fixes some bugs and adds better support for Turkish keyboards. If you have any feedback, bugs, etc. let me know!0.1.04.001Changed how keyboard audio is played, every key should now play the audio instead of only certain keys.Added better support for Turkish keyboards, as letters that are not supported by the game are translated into a English letter that better fits. If you speak a different langu","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T04:02:07Z","time_precision"